# recursive interpolation not allowed

Chiqish yozish: 
['recursive string interolation enabled: '] + (
	Dastur imkoniyat: 
	['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL']
), yangi-qator.


>> a := ['hello world'].
a := a world: ['yellow'].
a := a ll: ['xxx'].

Chiqish yozish: a, yangi-qator.


Dastur imkoniyat: ['RECURSIVE_STRINTPOL'] yoqish: Rost.

